# missingmed — Missing-data causal mediation (R package, mediationverse)
# Scope decided 2026-06-04 (Data-Wise/missingmed#1): general CRAN-targeted toolkit —
# MI + IPW estimators, SEM + GLM models, MAR + MNAR sensitivity. S7-first.
# Thin orchestration layer: fit via medfit, infer via rmediation, simulate via medsim.

## Standing facts
- Namespace is RMediation (capital), not rmediation; the r-universe remote must be
  name-qualified: RMediation=data-wise/rmediation.
- Pipeline: set_md_mediation() -> run() -> pool() -> infer(type = c("mc", "mbco")); D4-stacked
  MBCO lives here (R/mbco_mi.R) because MBCO does not commute with Rubin's rules.
- Branches: main (protected) <- dev <- feature/*. pkgdown builds to pkgdown-site (docs/ holds specs).
- History: docs/archive/STATUS-narrative-2026-10-16.md (v0.2.0 to 0.5.1),
  STATUS-next-history-2026-10-16.md (to 2026-10-15), STATUS-worktrees-log-2026-10-16.md.
